  "description": "*“I really like this actor.”*\n\nYun Sang has been cast in Netflix Korea’s new drama Aftermath. His character’s love interest is Jeong Do-Hwan, a genius actor in the indie film scene whom he’s secretly admired. But when they finally meet, he turns out to be a man who’s completely impossible to figure out…?!\n\nPlayful yet serious, affectionate yet rude, Yun Sang, a hopeless romantic, finds himself completely at the mercy of Do-Hwan, a free spirit whose “Prince Alpha” nickname rings hollow. Do-Hwan seems to have mixed feelings but rarely crosses the line. Even after playing arch-enemies on screen, Yun Sang ends up asking him out as soon as they turn away from the camera. Though he plays his Omega, in reality, pheromones don’t work on him at all. Love over defiance and pride! Can he win over the heart of this unassailable acting genius? With his reputation as a Hollywood Casanova, he’s determined to make him beg for more!\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
